# Her answers in a conversation beat, moved word for word out of Conversation.Unified.cs and
# SleepTease.cs (criteria D and F7 of koikatsu-decisao-criterios-falas-fixas). Read by Conversation.BeatSay.
# {tag} the option you took or the moment (cg_admit, db_now, caught.intro, sleeptease...), {q} how she took it:
# good | neutral | bad (yes | no for the sleeping tease). The rules without a tag are the stock answers for a beat
# whose option has none of its own; @weights beat makes the tag decide first.

# ================= stock answers (no tag of their own) =================
@rule beat.stock.good.gentle
on beat
when q=good tone=gentle
- ...Thank you. That really helps.
- ...That means a lot. Thank you.

@rule beat.stock.good.energetic
on beat
when q=good tone=energetic
- Yeah! Exactly! You get it!
- Right?! That's it exactly!

@rule beat.stock.good.cool
on beat
when q=good tone=cool
- ...Yeah. Thanks.
- ...Good answer.

@rule beat.stock.good.teasing
on beat
when q=good tone=teasing
- Heh. You're better at this than I thought.
- Look at you, saying the right thing~

@rule beat.stock.neutral.gentle
on beat
when q=neutral tone=gentle
- Mm... I guess so.
- ...Maybe you're right.

@rule beat.stock.neutral.energetic
on beat
when q=neutral tone=energetic
- Huh. Okay!
- Hmm! Could be!

@rule beat.stock.neutral.cool
on beat
when q=neutral tone=cool
- ...Sure.
- ...Possibly.

@rule beat.stock.neutral.teasing
on beat
when q=neutral tone=teasing
- If you say so.
- Hm. We'll see~

@rule beat.stock.bad.gentle
on beat
when q=bad tone=gentle
- ...Oh. Okay.
- ...That's not what I needed.

@rule beat.stock.bad.energetic
on beat
when q=bad tone=energetic
- Hey... that's not really what I meant.
- Ehh? That's not it at all!

@rule beat.stock.bad.cool
on beat
when q=bad tone=cool
- ...That didn't help.
- ...No.

@rule beat.stock.bad.teasing
on beat
when q=bad tone=teasing
- Wow. Read the room.
- Oof. Try again.

# ================= she knows you saw her (Caught) =================
@rule beat.caught.intro.gentle
on beat
when tag=caught.intro tone=gentle
feel shy
- ...You saw me. Back then. I know you did.
- ...You saw me. I know.
- ...Back then... you saw.
- ...I know you saw me.

@rule beat.caught.intro.energetic
on beat
when tag=caught.intro tone=energetic
feel shy
- You SAW! When I was... ugh! I know you saw!
- You SAW! I know!
- You walked in! Ugh!
- You saw me! I know it!

@rule beat.caught.intro.cool
on beat
when tag=caught.intro tone=cool
feel shy
- ...About when you walked in on me.
- ...When you walked in.
- ...About that incident.
- ...You saw.

@rule beat.caught.intro.teasing
on beat
when tag=caught.intro tone=teasing
feel shy
- So. You walked in on me. Let's talk about that.
- You walked in on me. Let's discuss.
- So. You saw. Let's talk.
- You got a show. Now talk.

@rule beat.cg_admit.gentle
on beat
when tag=cg_admit tone=gentle
- ...At least you're honest.
- ...Everything. Okay. Thank you for not pretending.
- ...I'd rather hear it from you than wonder.

@rule beat.cg_admit.energetic
on beat
when tag=cg_admit tone=energetic
- Everything?! ...Okay. Okay.
- You didn't have to say EVERYTHING! ...But okay.
- Ugh! Fine! At least you're not lying!

@rule beat.cg_admit.cool
on beat
when tag=cg_admit tone=cool
- ...Honest. Fine.
- ...So you saw. Noted.
- ...Straight answer. I'll take it.

@rule beat.cg_admit.teasing
on beat
when tag=cg_admit tone=teasing
- Everything, huh? ...Good.
- Everything? Then you owe me one. A big one.
- Honest, huh? ...Did you like it?

@rule beat.cg_explain.gentle
on beat
when tag=cg_explain tone=gentle
- ...I believe you.
- ...An accident. Okay. I can live with that.
- ...You knocked twice? ...Then it was my fault too.

@rule beat.cg_explain.energetic
on beat
when tag=cg_explain tone=energetic
- ...Okay, okay, I believe you!
- An accident! Right! Totally! ...I believe you, I think!
- Next time knock louder! Way louder!

@rule beat.cg_explain.cool
on beat
when tag=cg_explain tone=cool
- ...Fine.
- ...Accidents happen. Don't let it happen again.
- ...I'll accept that. Once.

@rule beat.cg_explain.teasing
on beat
when tag=cg_explain tone=teasing
- An accident. Sure~
- An accident? You're blushing like it wasn't.
- Sure, sure. A very lucky accident.

@rule beat.cg_secret.gentle
on beat
when tag=cg_secret tone=gentle
- ...Thank you. Really.
- ...Just between us. Promise me again.
- ...Thank you. I trust you with it.

@rule beat.cg_secret.energetic
on beat
when tag=cg_secret tone=energetic
- Promise?! Okay. Thanks.
- Pinky promise! Swear it! ...Okay. Good.
- If anyone finds out, I'm blaming you! ...Thanks.

@rule beat.cg_secret.cool
on beat
when tag=cg_secret tone=cool
- ...Good.
- ...Good. Keep it that way.
- ...Our secret, then. Don't make me regret it.

@rule beat.cg_secret.teasing
on beat
when tag=cg_secret tone=teasing
- ...Our secret, then.
- A secret, just us? ...I kind of like that.
- Then we're partners in crime now.

@rule beat.cg_feel.gentle
on beat
when tag=cg_feel tone=gentle
- ...You really think so?
- ...You really think so? ...That helps a little.
- ...Nothing to be ashamed of... I'll try to believe that.

@rule beat.cg_feel.energetic
on beat
when tag=cg_feel tone=energetic
- ...Really?
- Easy for you to say! ...But thanks. Really.
- Nothing to be ashamed of?! ...Okay. Okay, maybe.

@rule beat.cg_feel.cool
on beat
when tag=cg_feel tone=cool
- ...Hm.
- ...You're strangely calm about it.
- ...Maybe. I'll think about it.

@rule beat.cg_feel.teasing
on beat
when tag=cg_feel tone=teasing
- ...Smooth.
- Nothing to be ashamed of? Then you won't mind if I watch you sometime.
- So you're saying you liked what you saw.

@rule beat.cg_space.gentle
on beat
when tag=cg_space tone=gentle
- ...Okay.
- ...Thank you. I'm not ready yet.
- ...Later. Maybe. Thanks for waiting.

@rule beat.cg_space.energetic
on beat
when tag=cg_space tone=energetic
- ...Yeah. Let's drop it!
- Yes! Let's never talk about it! ...For now!
- Good call! Great call! Moving on!

@rule beat.cg_space.cool
on beat
when tag=cg_space tone=cool
- ...Fine.
- ...Wise.
- ...Fine by me.

@rule beat.cg_space.teasing
on beat
when tag=cg_space tone=teasing
- ...Coward. ...Fine.
- Running away? ...Okay. This time.
- Scared of the answer? ...I'll let you off.

# ================= what she owes you (Debt) =================
@rule beat.debt.intro.gentle
on beat
when tag=debt.intro tone=gentle
feel shy
- ...About what I owe you. I haven't forgotten.
- ...What I owe you. I remember.
- ...I haven't forgotten my promise.
- ...About what I owe...

@rule beat.debt.intro.energetic
on beat
when tag=debt.intro tone=energetic
feel shy
- So... that thing I owe you. Yeah. I remember!
- That thing I owe you! I remember!
- My debt! Yep!
- I owe you! I know!

@rule beat.debt.intro.cool
on beat
when tag=debt.intro tone=cool
feel shy
- ...My debt. I keep my word.
- ...I owe you. I remember.
- ...Debt acknowledged.

@rule beat.debt.intro.teasing
on beat
when tag=debt.intro tone=teasing
feel shy
- Ah, my little debt. Here to collect?
- My debt? Collecting?
- Here to collect?
- Ah, the debt. Ready?

@rule beat.db_now.gentle
on beat
when tag=db_now tone=gentle
- ...Okay. Now, then.
- ...Okay. Now.
- ...Alright. Right now.
- ...Now, then.

@rule beat.db_now.energetic
on beat
when tag=db_now tone=energetic
- Now?! ...Okay!
- Now?! Okay!
- Right now?! Yes!
- Now! Alright!

@rule beat.db_now.cool
on beat
when tag=db_now tone=cool
- ...Fine. Now.
- ...Now.
- ...Fine.
- ...Very well.

@rule beat.db_now.teasing
on beat
when tag=db_now tone=teasing
- Now? Bold. I like it.
- Now? Bold.
- Right now? I like it.
- Eager. Good.

@rule beat.db_later.gentle
on beat
when tag=db_later tone=gentle
- ...Then I'll be waiting.
- ...I'll wait.
- ...I'll be waiting for you.
- ...Later, then.

@rule beat.db_later.energetic
on beat
when tag=db_later tone=energetic
- Later! It's a promise!
- Later! Promise!
- Later! Deal!
- Okay! Later!

@rule beat.db_later.cool
on beat
when tag=db_later tone=cool
- ...I'll remember.
- ...Remembered.
- ...Noted.
- ...Later.

@rule beat.db_later.teasing
on beat
when tag=db_later tone=teasing
- I'll hold you to it.
- Don't forget.
- Later, then.

# ================= the sleeping tease (SleepTease) =================
@rule beat.sleeptease.yes.gentle
on beat
when tag=sleeptease q=yes tone=gentle
feel love
- Mmh... hm? ...Oh. It's you... Don't stop...
- Nn... you're here... It's okay. Stay a little longer...
- Mm... was I dreaming? ...No, it's really you. Don't go...
- Hm...? Oh... your hands are warm. ...Keep going.

@rule beat.sleeptease.yes.energetic
on beat
when tag=sleeptease q=yes tone=energetic
feel love
- Nnn... w-wha...? Hehe... sneaky. Come here, then.
- Huh...? Hey, no fair, I was asleep! ...Fine, don't stop now!
- Mmh... what time is— oh! Ehehe, okay, you caught me! Come closer!
- W-wake up call? Ha... sneaky, sneaky. Well? Don't just stand there!

@rule beat.sleeptease.yes.cool
on beat
when tag=sleeptease q=yes tone=cool
feel love
- ...You woke me up. ...Take responsibility.
- ...So this is how you wake people. ...Fine. Continue.
- ...I was asleep. You knew that. ...Don't stop halfway.
- ...Hm. Bold. ...I didn't say you could stop.

@rule beat.sleeptease.yes.teasing
on beat
when tag=sleeptease q=yes tone=teasing
feel love
- Mm~ ...Is this how you wake up a girl? Then do it properly.
- Mm~ ...took you long enough to try. Go on, then.
- Ara... a sleeping girl and you couldn't resist? Cute. Keep going.
- Nnh~ ...If you're going to wake me, at least make it worth it.

@rule beat.sleeptease.no.gentle
on beat
when tag=sleeptease q=no tone=gentle
feel surprised
- Hya?! W-what are you doing?!
- Eek?! Wh-what... why are you touching me while I sleep?!
- Ah?! N-no, don't! I was sleeping...!
- Hyah?! Th-that's not okay! Not while I'm asleep!

@rule beat.sleeptease.no.energetic
on beat
when tag=sleeptease q=no tone=energetic
feel surprised
- WHOA! Hey! I was sleeping!
- Hey-hey-HEY! What's the big idea?!
- Whoa, whoa! Not cool! I was napping!
- Yikes! Okay, NO. Hands where I can see them!

@rule beat.sleeptease.no.cool
on beat
when tag=sleeptease q=no tone=cool
feel surprised
- ...Hands. Off. Now.
- ...Don't. Touch. Me. While I sleep.
- ...Step back. Right now.
- ...I was asleep. That was not an invitation.

@rule beat.sleeptease.no.teasing
on beat
when tag=sleeptease q=no tone=teasing
feel surprised
- Ah-ah. Nice try. I'm awake now, you know.
- Oho? Caught red-handed. Not today, sweetie.
- Mm-mm. Sneaking up on me? You'll have to try harder.
- Ah, ah, ah~ I'm awake. And the answer is no.

# ================= narration around her answer =================
@rule beat.sneak.wary
on beat
when tag=sneak.wary
- {name} looks away, then back at you, and doesn't say no.
- {name} bites her lip, glances at the door, and doesn't say no.
- {name} goes quiet. Then, very small, a nod.

@rule beat.sneak.waryno
on beat
when tag=sneak.waryno
- {name} hesitates a moment too long before she answers.
- {name} opens her mouth, closes it, and looks at the floor.
- For a second {name} looks like she'll say yes.

@rule beat.private.wary
on beat
when tag=private.wary
- She looks away, red to the ears, but she doesn't change the subject.
- She hides her face in her hands, but she's smiling behind them.
- Her ears go red. She doesn't stop you.

# ================= narration of the touch, the look, the caught talk and the sleeping tease =================
@rule beat.grope.bust.narr
on beat
when tag=grope.bust.narr
- Your hand brushes {name}'s chest.
- Your fingers graze the front of {name}'s blouse.
- Your hand lingers a little too long against {name}'s chest.

@rule beat.grope.hip.narr
on beat
when tag=grope.hip.narr
- Your hand slides down to {name}'s hip.
- Your hand settles on the curve of {name}'s hip.
- You let your hand drift lower, to {name}'s hip.

@rule beat.look.bold.narr
on beat
when tag=look.bold.narr
- Your eyes wander over {name}.
- Your gaze drifts down {name}, slowly.
- You catch yourself staring at {name}, and you don't look away.

@rule beat.look.hand.narr
on beat
when tag=look.hand.narr
- You look at {name}'s hands.
- Your eyes rest on {name}'s fingers for a moment.
- You notice how small {name}'s hands are.

@rule beat.look.face.narr
on beat
when tag=look.face.narr
- You look at {name}'s face for a moment.
- You watch {name}'s face while she talks.
- For a moment you just look at {name}.

@rule beat.caught.narr
on beat
when tag=caught.narr
- {name} goes red the moment you bring it up.
- {name} freezes, and the color rises all the way to her ears.
- {name} can't look at you once you bring it up.

@rule beat.sleeptease.asleep
on beat
when tag=sleeptease.asleep
- {name} is fast asleep on the infirmary bed, breathing softly. The curtain is half drawn.
- {name} is curled up asleep on the infirmary bed. Nobody else is around.
- Behind the half-drawn curtain, {name} sleeps with one arm over her face.

@rule beat.sleeptease.leave
on beat
when tag=sleeptease.leave
- You pull the curtain closed and leave her be.
- You draw the curtain shut and tiptoe out.
- You let her sleep and close the door softly behind you.

@rule beat.sleeptease.tease
on beat
when tag=sleeptease.tease
- You sit on the edge of the bed and brush the hair from her face, then let your hand wander.
- You sit beside her, tuck a strand of hair behind her ear, and let your fingers trail lower.
- The bed creaks as you sit down. You brush her cheek, then your hand keeps going.

@rule beat.sleeptease.yes.narr
on beat
when tag=sleeptease.yes.narr
- She pulls you down by your collar, still half asleep.
- Still half asleep, she wraps her arms around your neck and pulls you in.
- She smiles without opening her eyes and drags you down next to her.

@rule beat.sleeptease.no.narr
on beat
when tag=sleeptease.no.narr
- She sits up and pulls the blanket over herself.
- She bolts upright and clutches the blanket to her chest.
- She scrambles back against the wall, blanket up to her chin.

@rule beat.kiss.yes.narr
on beat
when tag=kiss.yes.narr
- You lean in and kiss her softly.
- You touch her lips, then lean in and kiss her.
- You lean in. She doesn't pull away, and your lips meet.
- You brush her lips with a finger and kiss her before she can say a word.
- You pull her close by the waist and kiss her, slow and sure.
- She tilts her face up first, and you meet her halfway.

@rule beat.kiss.wary.narr
on beat
when tag=kiss.wary.narr
- You lean in. She stiffens, hesitates... and doesn't pull away.
- Your lips meet hers. She holds still, eyes squeezed shut.
- You lean in slowly. She flinches, then lets you kiss her.
- She freezes when you lean in, but she doesn't turn her face away.
- She goes stiff as a board, but when your lips touch hers she doesn't move away.
- Her breath catches. She lets you kiss her, fists balled at her sides.

@rule beat.kiss.waryno.narr
on beat
when tag=kiss.waryno.narr
- You lean in. She leans in too... then stops an inch away and turns aside, flustered.
- Your lips almost meet. She pulls back at the last second, cheeks burning.
- She closes her eyes when you lean in, then catches herself and steps back.
- For a moment she lets you come close. Then she puts a finger on your lips.
- She sways toward you, then ducks her head at the very last moment.
- She almost lets you. Then she laughs nervously and turns her cheek.

@rule beat.kiss.no.narr
on beat
when tag=kiss.no.narr
- You lean in for a kiss. She turns her face away.
- Your finger brushes her lips; she steps back before you can lean in.
- You lean in. She puts a hand on your chest and stops you.
- She leans back out of reach and shakes her head.
- "No," she says quietly, and turns away.
